 * Stores a report pushed by a project and updates `projects.last_report_at`. A repeated
 * `batchId` returns the stored report (`wasRecentlyCreated` false) and stores nothing new.
 * The report's optional `release` and `deployedAt` (#106) are kept in their own columns: a
 * report with `deployed_at` is the project's deploy marker. The optional `environment` (core
 * #203) becomes the project's environment; a report without one (standalone CLI, older cores)
 * keeps the last known value, and a value that does not match `Project::ENVIRONMENT_PATTERN` is
 * dropped, never stored. Each new report moves the project's finding lifecycle (#18) before the
 * alerts read what changed.
 */";s:10:"attributes";a:0:{}s:9:"startLine";i:27;s:7:"endLine";i:160;s:11:"startColumn";i:1;s:9:"endColumn";i:1;s:15:"parentClassName";N;s:20:"implementsClassNames";a:0:{}s:15:"traitClassNames";a:0:{}s:18:"immediateConstants";a:1:{s:20:"TRANSACTION_ATTEMPTS";a:12:{s:18:"declaringClassName";s:35:"App\Actions\StorePushedReportAction";s:21:"implementingClassName";s:35:"App\Actions\StorePushedReportAction";s:4:"name";s:20:"TRANSACTION_ATTEMPTS";s:9:"modifiers";i:4;s:4:"type";N;s:5:"value";a:2:{s:4:"code";s:1:"3";s:10:"attributes";a:6:{s:9:"startLine";i:34;s:7:"endLine";i:34;s:13:"startTokenPos";i:78;s:12:"startFilePos";i:1372;s:11:"endTokenPos";i:78;s:10:"endFilePos";i:1372;}}s:10:"docComment";s:210:"/**
